        "verse": 4
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JHN",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "But when day had already come, Jesus stood on the beach; yet the disciples didn’t know that it was Jesus.",
      "ko": "날이 새어갈 때에 예수께서 바닷가에 서셨으나 제자들이 예수신줄 알지 못하는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "88c17156f42a58235c92f2ce9a305be7faf1f705c7bd29d4a30365b34d412441",
      "translation_text_hash": "5fbf1fe8f03cccfab6a5e3fc91680daee2a913a2a77427873a2c6eec495b38d6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "날이 새어갈 때에 예수께서 바닷가에 서셨으나 제자들이 예수신줄 알지 못하는지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5fbf1fe8f03cccfab6a5e3fc91680daee2a913a2a77427873a2c6eec495b38d6"
