      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JHN",
          "chapter": 21,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "Jesus therefore said to them, “Children, have you anything to eat?” They answered him, “No.”",
      "ko": "예수께서 이르시되 얘들아 너희에게 고기가 있느냐 대답하되 없나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "a52f3b1512593587c346844e3f8835e8a72352dfd0eedde6905417cd3f6cec2e",
      "translation_text_hash": "2effb9cbc0ae05793605965b12731ce74efd9e36bf82f0610c9e57664a4678c9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "예수께서 이르시되 얘들아 너희에게 고기가 있느냐 대답하되 없나이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2effb9cbc0ae05793605965b12731ce74efd9e36bf82f0610c9e57664a4678c9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JHN:21:6",
      "sequence": 26904,
      "chapter_label": "JHN 21",
