      "en": "Jesus said to them, “Bring some of the fish which you have just caught.”",
      "ko": "예수께서 가라사대 지금 잡은 생선을 좀 가져오라 하신대",
      "source_text_hash": "6b2d72ddbb3e4187d6aac5870a5971716f04b81a4749b06d4c43a02653b4263b",
      "translation_text_hash": "7064a4a42d583c635226e1056947a70ff3481453f5b7ed061221499529edf756",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "예수께서 가라사대 지금 잡은 생선을 좀 가져오라 하신대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7064a4a42d583c635226e1056947a70ff3481453f5b7ed061221499529edf756"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JHN:21:11",
      "sequence": 26909,
      "chapter_label": "JHN 21",
      "verse_label": "11",
      "locator": {
