      "en": "Now he said this, signifying by what kind of death he would glorify God. When he had said this, he said to him, “Follow me.”",
      "ko": "이 말씀을 하심은 베드로가 어떠한 죽음으로 하나님께 영광을 돌릴 것을 가리키심이러라 이 말씀을 하시고 베드로에게 이르시되 나를 따르라 하시니",
      "source_text_hash": "fb391717ad1abe5692e0d7bc20c51a711b1b51c1074a6ee99786fecc8f61321c",
      "translation_text_hash": "b1fff2b4215cb459291c06d168773c3519a49d690f130434151bf7e837182ba2",
